    "description": "The Transfer Management API facilitates the execution of fund transfers between banking accounts. This API allows users to initiate transfers smoothly, enhancing operational efficiency for financial transactions. Typical consumers include financial institutions, banking applications, and fintech services that require seamless transaction capabilities. By enabling users to transfer funds programmatically, the API supports various use cases such as payment processing, peer-to-peer transfers, and automated accounting functions.",
